sequenceDiagram
 participant W as Worker
 participant I as Image provider
 participant S as Object storage
 participant P as PostgreSQL
 W->>I: generate approved image
 I-->>W: candidate bytes
 W->>S: persist permanent object
 W->>S: verify reachability/hash
 W->>P: link approved asset
 Note over W,P: READY requires 4 actions and 16 reachable assets
